This file lists the third-party software shipped in the bioseasy container image and in the
pairing helper app, with each component's version, upstream source and license. Every license
below is compatible with distribution under GPL-3.0-or-later. Versions are those pinned in
`uv.lock`; development and test tools are not shipped and not listed.
`scripts/check_notice_coverage.py` fails the test suite when a runtime dependency in `uv.lock` is
missing here.

