## Obtaining the corresponding source (GPL-3.0 section 6)

- **bioseasy itself**: this repository, at the tag of the release you have.
- **Python packages**: the Source column links each package's upstream repository; the exact
  version pinned in `uv.lock` is also available as an sdist from
  `https://pypi.org/project/<name>/<version>/`.
- **rsync and usbmuxd**: the Debian source packages, from the `salsa.debian.org` links above, from
  `https://packages.debian.org/src:rsync` and `https://packages.debian.org/src:usbmuxd`, or with
  `apt-get source` against a Debian trixie mirror.
- None of these components is modified by bioseasy.

